# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Pauli propagation"
msgstr "Mga tagubilin sa pag-install para sa pinakabagong bersyon ng Pauli propagation"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Mga tagubilin sa pag-install"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Mga tagubilin sa pag-install {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Mga paunang kinakailangan {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Una, gumawa ng minimal na environment na Python lang ang naka-install. Inirerekomenda naming gumamit ng [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "I-activate ang bago mong environment.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package – from PyPI or source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "May dalawang pangunahing paraan para i-install ang package na ito – mula sa PyPI o sa source. Ang inirerekomendang paraan ay mag-install mula sa PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Mag-install mula sa PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Mag-install mula sa source {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can install from source if you want to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally.\n"
msgstr "Maaari kang mag-install mula sa source kung gusto mong mag-develop sa repository o patakbuhin ang mga notebook nang lokal.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, clone the `pauli-prop` repository.\n"
msgstr "Una, i-clone ang `pauli-prop` repository.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, install the Rust toolchain, upgrade pip, and enter the repository. Refer to the [Rust documentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) for instructions on installing the toolchain.\n"
msgstr "Susunod, i-install ang Rust toolchain, i-upgrade ang pip, at pumasok sa repository. Tingnan ang [dokumentasyon ng Rust](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) para sa mga tagubilin sa pag-install ng toolchain.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `pauli-prop` to the virtual environment. Install the notebook dependencies if you want to run all the visualizations in the notebooks. If you plan on developing in the repository, you can install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Ang susunod na hakbang ay i-install ang `pauli-prop` sa virtual environment. I-install ang mga dependency ng notebook kung gusto mong patakbuhin ang lahat ng visualization sa mga notebook. Kung balak mong mag-develop sa repository, maaari mong i-install ang mga dependency na `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Ayusin ang mga opsyon sa ibaba ayon sa iyong pangangailangan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs.\n"
msgstr "Kung na-install mo ang mga dependency ng notebook, maaari kang magsimula sa pamamagitan ng pagpapatakbo ng mga notebook sa docs.\n"
